# srp2b: CScriptRiftPortal e00070073 (Temple Grounds 12_temple_finalgate). Activate + Increment open
# the portal, so Render runs every frame; the gdb fixture (tools/cov/specs/srp2_render.py) owns the
# first four non-early Render calls (natural, maxY forced min arm, forced max arm, natural).
@f300 god 1; obj e00070073; tp 4.5 118.7 -16.6; face 0
@f340 send e00070073 Activate; obj e00070073
@f420 send e00070073 Increment
@f700 obj e00070073; screenshot
@f760 obj e00070073; screenshot
